cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite the paper below."
title: "Online Modelling for Real-Time Chiller Efficiency Optimization: co-simulation testbed, load forecasting, online efficiency tracking and staging-decision analysis"
abstract: >-
  Code for a verified chiller-plant co-simulation testbed (3R2C building,
  three-chiller water-cooled plant with DOE-2 Electric EIR curves, time-of-use
  tariff), short-horizon cooling-load forecasting with walk-forward evaluation,
  recursive-least-squares online identification of chiller efficiency under
  injected drift, and a quasi-static analysis of how forecast and model errors
  propagate into the chiller staging decision. All results are from simulation;
  no measured plant data was used.
type: software
